&lt;p data-pos=&quot;0&quot;&gt;At JetBrains, code is our passion. Ever since we started, back in 2000, we have been striving to make the most effective developer tools on earth. Our tools speed up production by automating routine checks and corrections, freeing developers to grow, discover, and create.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pos=&quot;274&quot;&gt;The Business Applications Development team is a vital integrational hub within JetBrains. We are focused on supporting businesses by automating sales flow and license management, as well as by developing other internal and external services. We ensure the completeness, continuity, and high quality of JetBrains’ sales and licensing processes. Our solutions are a family of web applications written mostly in Kotlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pos=&quot;692&quot;&gt;We are currently looking for a Senior QA Engineer to join the team and support our efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;as-part-of-our-team-you-will&quot; data-pos=&quot;789&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-pos=&quot;791&quot;&gt;As part of our team, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-pos=&quot;825&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-pos=&quot;825&quot;&gt;Design, improve, and execute test scenarios for new and existing functionalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pos=&quot;909&quot;&gt;Use an exploratory testing approach on a daily basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pos=&quot;965&quot;&gt;Investigate, identify, and reproduce complex issues reported by users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pos=&quot;1038&quot;&gt;Participate in discussions about new projects and review feature requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pos=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;Communicate closely with your teammates and other teams to find optimal solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
