&lt;ul data-pos=&quot;1261&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-pos=&quot;1261&quot;&gt;Have at least 3 years (preferred) of experience in web applications or SaaS testing (white box).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pos=&quot;1348&quot;&gt;Have good knowledge of browser tools such as DevTools, Postman, and various code sniffers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pos=&quot;1441&quot;&gt;Can read and write code in Java/Kotlin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pos=&quot;1483&quot;&gt;Are comfortable writing complex SQL queries to get the data you need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pos=&quot;1555&quot;&gt;Strive to clearly understand the architecture of the applications you test.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pos=&quot;1633&quot;&gt;Understand web application security mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pos=&quot;1683&quot;&gt;Are capable of working with different processes and in varied environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pos=&quot;1761&quot;&gt;Are open to other points of view and can reasonably defend your own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pos=&quot;1832&quot;&gt;Adhere to the principle that decisions should be based on facts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
