&lt;ul data-pos=&quot;1946&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-pos=&quot;1946&quot;&gt;Have a basic understanding of containerization principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pos=&quot;2007&quot;&gt;Can easily use *nix command tools like man, grep, find, sed, netstat, and awk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
