&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience working with VSCode.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are familiar with IntelliJ IDEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience building automated testing infrastructure and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
