&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate a high-performance agile development team balancing executing new features while maintaining our existing system health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a team of full-stack engineers to deliver internal platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold regular 1:1s, mentor engineers, and work with contractors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Directors to drive engineering vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with product to develop solutions that align with business cases and strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constantly improve our platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment with new technologies and integrate them into our stack when appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience working in an agile team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing unit and integration tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reviewing code changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and analytical skills paired with the ability to drive complex projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in music and in learning the intricacies of the music business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to influence cross-functional teams and create a consensus between engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal, written, and visual communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with React/frontend JS is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years in an engineering management role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience building and maintaining complex software products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in a scripting language such as Python, PHP, JavaScript, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
